  "sourceTitle": "Sugar Paint Icing",
  "sourceText": "Sugar Paint Icing\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, December 12, 2009 - 12:23am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 1/4 cups powdered sugar\n4 teaspoons soft butter\n1/2 teaspoon vanilla\n2 tablespoons milk\nFood coloring\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients together until smooth. Divide icing into different bowls and add coloring as desired. Paint cookies with pastry brush or clean water color brushes.",
